{"parentUuid":"9a16fedc-2ad9-4716-b51a-fd6a0f5d4199","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d61091f7-1a1a-47e5-9cf9-c1a8a50daaaa","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"<command-message>loop</command-message>\n<command-name>/loop</command-name>\n<command-args>continue until v1.2.0 release</command-args>"},"uuid":"7a97473b-c701-4a80-ab8b-0f22be62deb3","timestamp":"2026-11-15T07:34:40.841Z","wakeupSource":"loop_wakeup","scheduledTaskId":"b8b33139","scheduledFireId":"9a16fedc-2ad9-4716-b51a-fd6a0f5d4199","turnOrigin":"scheduled","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":78,"turnIndex":489},"queuePriority":"later","queueSkipAttachments":true,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
{"parentUuid":"7a97473b-c701-4a80-ab8b-0f22be62deb3","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d61091f7-1a1a-47e5-9cf9-c1a8a50daaaa","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Base directory for this skill: /home/mike/.claude/skills/loop\n\n# /loop\nParse input as `[interval] <prompt>`: a first token matching ^\\d+[smhd]$ is the interval; else a trailing `every <N> <unit>` (only when a time follows \"every\"); else no interval (dynamic). Empty prompt → print `/loop [interval] <prompt>` and stop.\n\n## Fixed interval\nCron: Nm≤59 → `*/N * * * *`; Nm≥60 or Nh → `0 */H * * *`; Nd → `0 0 */N * *`; Ns → round up to minutes. Round uneven intervals to the nearest clean one and say so. CronCreate (recurring: true), confirm cadence + job ID in one line (expires after 7 days; cancel with CronDelete), then run the prompt now.\n\n## Dynamic\n1. Run the prompt now (slash command → Skill tool).\n2. If the next run waits on an event, arm one Monitor (timeout_ms 1800000) unless TaskList shows one running.\n3. If work remains: ScheduleWakeup with prompt `/loop <original input>`, delaySeconds 1200–1800 unless something specific changes sooner, noop true when nothing changed. Re-arming is a choice, not a default.\n4. Confirm in one short visible line.\n5. To stop: ScheduleWakeup stop:true, TaskStop any Monitor, one-line PushNotification (skip if the user asked to stop), then write the outcome.\n\n\nARGUMENTS: continue until v1.2.0 release"}]},"isMeta":true,"turnCompanion":true,"uuid":"8eb61e06-3988-4a16-a0e5-e9a69a8dc663","timestamp":"2026-11-15T07:34:40.841Z","wakeupSource":"loop_wakeup","queuePriority":"later","queueSkipAttachments":true,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"6473a60e-9fa2-4bd9-9d0c-35324295cf68","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"robust-rolling-otter"}
